  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building His Future With Wood</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raphael has a plan set in oak: Become a carpenter and a wood carving artist to help support his family; one older brother and a single mother. That&apos;s why he, like his brother before him, is a student at Have Hammer...Will Travel.   For those students who can afford it, there is a nominal tuition. For those who can&apos;t, like Raphael, it&apos;s free. Your donations not only pay rent, utilities, teachers, materials and upkeep of machinery and tools, but give kids like Raphael hope for the future.</narrative>
  </description>
